SUMMARY:Jizo Peace Project  — Sebastopol Center For the Arts\, Californi
 a
DTSTART:20260904T000000
DTEND:20260905T000000
UID:5578abd80bfe95d59d69687af0c63e63@sebarts.org
DESCRIPTION:Jizo Peace Project: Clay Gathering for Remembrance and Peace\,
  September\n\n  \n    \n      \n        \n          $10.00\n        \n    
   \n    \n  \n\nFriday\, September 4\, 2026\; 1:30 – 4:00pmDue to limite
 d capacity\, we are asking for a suggested donation of $10 to the Sebastop
 ol Center for the Arts to confirm your attendance. Bring a copy of your re
 ceipt at check-in to Painting/Drawing Studio adjacent to Ceramics Studio. 
 Additional donations are welcome at the time of the class to cover rental 
 and expenses for the peace project. Join us for a monthly\, heart-centered
  gathering where we come together to create Jizo guardians out of clay—s
 ymbols of compassion\, protection\, and peace. Rooted in the Buddhist trad
 ition and echoed across many cultures\, Jizo figures traditionally honor c
 hildren and all who have passed\, those in transition\, and those in distr
 ess.This ongoing project is dedicated to remembering those lost to war\, w
 ith a special focus now on the approximately 19\,000 children who have per
 ished in Israel and Gaza in recent years. Through the simple\, meditative 
 act of working with clay\, we create benevolent beings that will become pa
 rt of public exhibits and peace sites\, offering spaces for reflection\, m
 ourning\, and hope. Our gatherings conclude with a gentle ritual to honor 
 the lives of these children.Located in the Painting & Drawing Room. The ga
 thering is open to ages 12 - adult\, and no prior clay experience is neces
 sary—all clay and basic materials are supplied. Registration is required
  to participate.Donations are welcome to help cover materials and expenses
 . More than a class\, this is a shared space of warmth and care—an oppor
 tunity to tend to our own hearts while taking part in love in action.\n\n\
 n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n          \n 
