 r 11 - October 16\, 2026 (6 sessions)5pm - 7:30pm$205 + $45 clay feeMaximu
 m 10 studentsThere will be an initial demo on throwing and trimming\, and 
 you will also receive one-on-one guidance.The class will end with learning
  to attach a handle to a cup and glazing the cup with your chosen colors.T
